  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-41301" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening UN-Nutrition coordination country mechanism towards delivering as one.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The envisaged overall impact of the project is a strengthened and efficient joint UN support to country efforts towards the achievement of global and national nutrition targets, realization of the N4G country commitments, and implementation of the national food systems pathways, by delivering as one UN for nutrition action and enabling the consumption of healthy diets from sustainable food systems to the benefit of all SDGs.
The project will work to achieve within the given timeframe and resources allocated to the project the following thee (3) outcomes:
Outcome 1: Strengthened alignment between global initiatives and approaches for nutrition and UN joint nutrition action in countries.
Outcome 2: Enhanced government capacity for multisectoral and coherent nutrition planning, programming and coordination for nutrition in countries.
Outcome 3: Joint and aligned planning of UN agencies and enhanced UN coordination in countries in support to governments and their stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
